course: dictionary
lesson: 7635
title: One word, more than one meaning
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning. The context tells you which meaning is right. The word «producer» can mean a person or company that makes things, a living thing that makes its own food, or the person in charge of making a film or show.
explain: Look at the words around it. «Producers make their own food using the energy of sunlight» is about plants in science, because of food and sunlight. «Twists on reality shows are usually planned by producers» is about making television, because of reality shows.
explain: Ask yourself: what word would fit here? Then put your meaning into the sentence in place of the hard word. If it still makes sense, you have found the right meaning.
fact: A producer is a person, company or country that makes or grows things to sell.
fact: In science, a producer is a living thing, such as a plant, that makes its own food from sunlight.
fact: In a food chain, grass is the producer, and arrows point from food to the eater.
fact: A film producer is in charge of making a film, TV show, play or music record.
fact: Phrases to know: «food producer», «film producer» and «producers and consumers».
exercise: «Producers make their own food using the energy of sunlight.» In this sentence, what is a producer? | A fox that eats rabbits | A person who buys food in a shop | *A living thing, such as a plant, that makes its own food
exercise: «Twists on reality shows are usually planned by producers to keep people watching.» What does producer mean here? | A plant that grows in the sun | A shop that sells games | *A person in charge of making a TV show
exercise: In the food chain grass, rabbit, fox, which is the producer? | Fox | Rabbit | *Grass | The arrow
test: A farm that grows apples and sells them to shops is a what? | Consumer | Carnivore | Herbivore | *Producer
test: «Big games are made by teams: programmers, artists, designers, writers, sound and music people, testers, producers and more.» Which of these is a job in making a game? | Herbivore | *Producers | Rabbit | Sunlight
exam: In «Maddie's favourite game was made by over 300 people», what does the sentence tell you about producers? | They are shops that sell games | They are the animals that eat grass | *They are among the people who help make a game | They are plants that make food from sunlight
